  "description": "Garmin Connect authentication for unattended, multi-user hosts: log in once and obtain the long-lived OAuth1 token so short-lived OAuth2 tokens can later be minted without the password. Vendors the MIT-licensed SSO flow from sealbro/dotnet.garmin.connect.",
  "id": "GarminRunerz.Connect.Auth",
