  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "RefreshOAuth2Async now reports temporary exchange failures (rate limit, server error, network) as GarminAuthenticationException and keeps GarminReconnectRequiredException for a rejected OAuth1 token (401/403). Migration: retry later on GarminAuthenticationException; prompt a reconnect only on GarminReconnectRequiredException. New GarminAuthClient(HttpClient, TimeProvider) constructor drives the 429 backoff delays. Vendored login code synced with sealbro/dotnet.garmin.connect 0.10.0 (429 backoff and status check on the token exchange, HTTP/2 Set-Cookie handling).",
